{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9150d717b85bcbd73b7e2d5fd0e90632.webp?t=1762283327\" width=378 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have been activated by the Felsat Organization\u2014forced into abandoned research facilities that house unspeakable terrors.... those that lurk in the shadows.... and those that lurk in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4b89604064770d4e86f5971f5867eee5.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4b89604064770d4e86f5971f5867eee5.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Class Based Progression</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Select your class and build your character<i> -\u00a0Choose between 4 unique classes with unique abilities and stats then build your character as you play</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute -</strong> A class built around strength <strong>-\u00a0</strong>destroy the clutter in your way with ease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief -</strong> Speed and Agility<strong> -</strong> Run, jump, and slide your way through the facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggler -</strong> Money Maker - Cheaper buys and the ability to access the shop remotely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journeyman -</strong> Jack of all trades and master of none - The perfect class to carve out the playstyle during your run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/393a24bfc335643b82d09c42ff68966a.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/393a24bfc335643b82d09c42ff68966a.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every enemy requires a different approach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Entities hide from you, watch you, hide as other objects, or pretend to be your friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They are not friendly. Use all the tools you're given to fend them off... or run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/e6923ee92808dbdb4d580f3b60c4b75c.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/e6923ee92808dbdb4d580f3b60c4b75c.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Robust Sanity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your mind may be the biggest threat of all... Keep your sanity meter full before the world warps around you. The further your sanity meter descends, you will see and hear things that may or may not be there, let it drain completely and you'll question everything you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/cb7e45d519ac9c5193c38058a307618b.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/cb7e45d519ac9c5193c38058a307618b.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel overpowered while underpowered</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grind your stats and you will have every advantage - speed, strength, money, mental fortitude... But don't forget these entities don't abide by the laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/70f61abcafd0e73256b05beeab19724e.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/70f61abcafd0e73256b05beeab19724e.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trial and Error</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is a desperate descent into procedurally generated dungeons where nothing stays the same for long. Time is limited\u2014you have only <strong>five days</strong> to complete your objective. As you run out of resources, and the entities who have occupied these facilities seem to enjoy\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Failure is inevitable, but not meaningless. Death, madness, and repetition feed into a larger cycle of growth. Survive, adapt, and carve your own path forward\u2014if you can keep your grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/5e54e71ea75b3e1feb945288256a53df.poster.avif?t=1762283327\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/5e54e71ea75b3e1feb945288256a53df.webm?t=1762283327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999430?t=1762283327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/58274c17a954b142342b412bfa10a72e48b04713/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762283327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/e215cc1a63c3eb3ce42fe5016035e77a56673e00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762283327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/e2